{"articleNo":"40574","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=40574&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012학년도 전기 대학원별 신입생 및 재학생 학적부기재사항 신고서 제출 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.02.22","hit":"8851","attachments":[{"name":"2012-1학기 학적부기재사항신고서(서식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=40574&attachNo=1969"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;<p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"center\" width=\"556\" bgcolor=\"#ffff99\" height=\"72\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY견고딕'\">2012 전기 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY견고딕'\">신입생 및 재학생 학적부 기재사항 신고서 제출 안내</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 101pt; TEXT-INDENT: -101pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1. 제출기간 : 2012. 3. 2(금) ~ 3. 30(금)까지 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 101pt; TEXT-INDENT: -101pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;각 종합학사행정실(각 학부건물 1층) 및 대학원행정실(본관 302호)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 101pt; TEXT-INDENT: -101pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;컨설팅대학원 행정실(글로벌관 458-1호)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 학적부 구비서류 : 학적부기재사항신고서(별도첨부), 사진(3×4) 1매, 주민등록등본 1부. </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 116.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -116.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 학생증 발급방법 : <u>학사서비스센터(학생회관 1층) 직접 방문 신청.</u></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 116.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -116.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">방문시 신분증 지참)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 학생증 발급 신청일로부터 약 2주후 수령 가능함.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2. 사진 등록(</span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">필수사항</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">) </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학적부 사진 등재는 학생증 발급 및 각종 학사업무 지원을 받을 수 있음.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">3. 사진 제출(</span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">사진 미제출자 재학생에 한함</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 이메일(sjajpg@kumoh.ac.kr)발송 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ jpg 이미지 파일을 학번과 성명을 표기하여 이메일로 발송</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 직접방문 및&nbsp; 우편송부</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 주소 : 730-701 경북 구미시 대학로 61 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;금오공과대학교 대학원지원팀(본관302호)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">학적부사진 미제출시 주의사항</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">학적부사진을 미제출한 학생은 원스톱서비스 사용 제한 및 학사관련 업무</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(수강신청, 휴학신청, 성적확인 등 ) 불가</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2012. 2.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">금오공과대학교 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅)장</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
